      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your body size doesn't make you immune to the fact that combining benadryl with hydrocodone creates a lethal cocktail known as \"polysomnography,\" which can shut down your breathing.\nJust because it's a \"small dose\" doesn't mean it's safe; the combination is a classic recipe for fatal respiratory depression that happens to anyone, regardless of weight.\nYou need to stop this immediately and call your doctor to get a proper sleep aid prescribed rather than risking your life on a dangerous DIY mix.",
