      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get it, you're trying to be safe, but my doctor isn't gonna answer until monday and i'm literally losing my mind here. i'm not asking to get high, i just need to not be in pain so i can sleep for a few hours. if i were to just take literally half of a benadryl tablet with my dose, would that actually be life-threatening? like, is there really no safe way to just take a tiny bit to take the edge off so i can rest?",
